# Flutter build-time configuration (pass via --dart-define)
#
# Production example:
# flutter run --dart-define=API_BASE_URL=https://your-backend.onrender.com \
#             --dart-define=SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co \
#             --dart-define=SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key
#
# Required manual entries:
# API_BASE_URL / needed          — deployed FastAPI URL (after Render deploy)
# SUPABASE_URL / needed          — from Supabase Dashboard → Project Settings → API
# SUPABASE_ANON_KEY / needed     — from Supabase Dashboard → Project Settings → API
